+   "status": "implemented locally (this browser only) on 2026-11-17",
+   "decision_value": "This is the only event that measures the thing an affiliate site is paid for, and the only one that can be counted honestly with no endpoint. A guide with zero outbound clicks on a product card is a card that is not doing its job, whichever way the traffic came."
+  },
+  {
+   "id": "EV-02",
+   "name": "cta_impression",
+   "definition": "A product call-to-action block became visible in the reader's viewport, so that clicks have a denominator.",
