+    "any identifier"
+   ],
+   "status": "implemented locally (this browser only) on 2026-11-17",
+   "decision_value": "The topic calendar is currently argued, not measured — data/topics.json says so on its own face. Arrivals per page is the smallest dataset that could replace that argument, and it is the one number Search Console will also give the owner centrally, which is why this event is a cross-check and not the source of truth."
+  },
+  {
+   "id": "EV-04",
+   "name": "guide_reached_end",
+   "definition": "A reader on an article page reached the article's closing block, which on this site is the 'read next' row rather than an ad load.",
+   "properties": [
