+   "status": "implemented locally (this browser only) on 2026-11-17",
+   "decision_value": "The brief asks for question-shaped guides and then asks whether anyone arrives. Arrival without completion cannot tell you whether the answer was useful; an article read to its end and never clicked is a different problem from an article abandoned at paragraph two, and the fix is different too."
