+  "why_empty": "Nothing in this repository has Associates report access. The brief's own rule — add figures 'only when obtained from authorized first-party reports' — produces an empty table on the first day, and an empty table with a schema is the deliverable. Filling it from a browser counter or a forecast would be the exact failure the brief warns against.",
+  "first_row_checklist": [
