cts/emeril_lagasse_french_door_airfryer_360" title="Emeril Everyday (brand) — Emeril Lagasse French Door AirFryer 360 Toaster Oven Combo, 26 QT — product page" rel="noopener" target="_blank">S14</a></div></td></tr><tr><td><strong>N2 Small-kitchen and counter-space buying</strong><div class="tiny muted">All three products publish outer dimensions on their own pages (13.38 × 11.81 × 10.63 in; 16.9 D × 15.8 W × 14.8 H in; 15.4 × 12.6 × 13.5 in), so a dimension-led comparison is fully sourced. But only one of the three is small, so the topic supply thins out quickly.</div></td><td class="num">3</td><td class="num">2</td><td class="num">2</td><td class="num">2</td><td class="num">3</td><td class="num"><strong>12</strong></td><td class="small">Strong secondary cluster — use it as internal-link fuel for N1<div class="tiny"><a class="src" href="https://chefman.com/products/turbofry-touch-dual-window-air-fryer" title="Chefman (brand) — Chefman TurboFry Touch 6 Qt. Dual-Window Air Fryer — product page" rel="noopener" target="_blank">S10</a> <a class="src" href="https://chefman.com/collections/air-fryers-1/products/turbofry-touch-air-fryer-1" title="Chefman (brand) — Chefman 8 Qt. TurboFry Touch Stainless-Steel Air Fryer — product page" rel="noopener" target="_blank">S12</a> <a class="src" href="https://www.emerileveryday.com/products/emeril_lagasse_french_door_airfryer_360" title="Emeril Everyday (brand) — Emeril Lagasse French Door AirFryer 360 Toaster Oven Combo, 26 QT — product page" rel="noopener" target="_blank">S14</a></div></td></tr><tr><td><strong>N3 Air-fryer policy, disclosure and &#x27;is this review real&#x27; literacy</strong><div class="tiny muted">The site already holds verbatim policy text (S1–S9) and a source-forensics article. Competition is low because most affiliate sites will not publish it. But the intent is informational, converts poorly, and barely touches the three products.</div></td><td class="num">3</td><td class="num">1</td><td class="num">2</td><