-  <tbody><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-01">Q-01</a></td><td>Which exact manufacturer model number does each of the three supplied Amazon links point to?</td><td class="small">Product identity</td><td><span class="pill ok">Known and sourced</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://chefman.com/products/turbofry-touch-dual-window-air-fryer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-02">Q-02</a></td><td>Is the Chefman 8 Qt listing the RJ38-SQSS-8T the site maps it to, or the RJ38-8T-BLACK that documents the 450 F Hi-Fry?</td><td class="small">Product identity</td><td><span class="pill ok">Known and sourced</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://chefman.com/collections/air-fryers-1/products/turbofry-touch-air-fryer-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-03">Q-03</a></td><td>Is the Amazon Associates account approved, in review, or closed - and when did the current review window start?</td><td class="small">Programme status</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/node/topic/G8TW5AE9XL2VX9VM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-04">Q-04</a></td><td>Which Associates tag is inside the three supplied short links, and does it belong to this account?</td><td class="small">Attribution</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/operating/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-05">Q-05</a></td><td>Do you have, or can you get, Creators API access?</td><td class="small">Data access</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/operating/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-06">Q-06</a></td><td>What is the product weight of the Emeril 26 QT French Door, and is the weight published for the two Chefman models the product weight or the packaged weight?</td><td class="small">Catalogue data</td><td><span class="pill warn">The source does not state it</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://chefman.com/products/turbofry-touch-dual-window-air-fryer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-07">Q-07</a></td><td>Should this be one public site, and should it live on a domain you own?</td><td class="small">Site ownership</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/kanlerxz87-cyber/Zone1/blob/main/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">repo ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-08">Q-08</a></td><td>What may this site measure, and whose consent does that require?</td><td class="small">Measurement</td><td><span class="pill warn">Missing - discoverable</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/operating/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-09">Q-09</a></td><td>Who is the named author, and what may the site honestly claim about how content is produced?</td><td class="small">Authorship</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-D/part-465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-10">Q-10</a></td><td>Which search intent does each existing article own, and who is allowed to write the next one?</td><td class="small">Content strategy</td><td><span class="pill warn">Missing - discoverable</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://kanlerxz87-cyber.github.io/Zone1/articles/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/kanlerxz87-cyber/Zone1/blob/main/session-7111e2b6/articles-superseded.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">repo ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/kanlerxz87-cyber/Zone1/blob/main/data/articles.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">repo ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-11">Q-11</a></td><td>Which category has Amazon actually assigned to each ASIN, and therefore which commission rate applies?</td><td class="small">Economics</td><td><span class="pill warn">Missing - discoverable</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/node/topic/GRXPHT8U84RAYDXZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-12">Q-12</a></td><td>Is there any published statement on this site that a live official source contradicts today?</td><td class="small">Repository integrity</td><td><span class="pill warn">Missing - discoverable</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/operating/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-13">Q-13</a></td><td>What exactly does the current application-review process require, in its own words?</td><td class="small">Programme viability</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/node/topic/G8TW5AE9XL2VX9VM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-14">Q-14</a></td><td>What is the actual conversion rate for these three products, and what would one sale be worth?</td><td class="small">Economics</td><td><span class="pill bad">Needs account access</span></td><td class="small"><a href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/node/topic/GRXPHT8U84RAYDXZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source ↗</a> </td></tr><tr><td class="num"><a href="#q-15">Q-15</