+  <p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> It decides whether the site is a three-product air-fryer guide or a kitchen-tools publication, and that decision moves the navigation, the category page, the internal-link graph and the commission-category argument. Guessing from a redirect would put unconfirmed product claims on a page that gets paid for them.</p>
