+      <p class="small">Open each submitted link in the browser signed in to the Amazon account, read the listing title and the model line in Product information, and compare it with the intended product. If it matches, fill the four intended_product fields in data/product-intent-confirmations.json and rebuild; if it does not, write down what was meant and the register will show both.</p>
